-- dg4-s215-nonstock-members.l4 (s 114(c)(2): not to a nonprofit nonstock corporation).

§ `s 218 Voting trusts and other voting agreements`

§§ `s 218(a) The voting trust`

-- One stockholder or 2 or more may by agreement in writing deposit capital stock of an original issue with, or transfer capital
-- stock to, any person or entity authorized to act as trustee, to vest in the voting trustee the right to vote on it for any
-- period of time the agreement determines, on the terms and conditions the agreement states.
-- src:829 | One stockholder or 2 or more stockholders may by agreement in writing deposit capital stock of an original issue with or transfer capital stock to any person or persons, or entity or entities authorized to act as trustee, for the purpose of vesting in such person or persons, entity or entities, who may be designated voting trustee, or voting trustees, the right to vote thereon for any period of time determined by such agreement, upon the terms and conditions stated in such agreement. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
GIVEN `the agreement is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the stock is capital stock of an original issue deposited with, or capital stock transferred to, a person or entity authorized to act as trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the purpose is to vest in the voting trustee the right to vote on the stock for a period of time the agreement determines` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(a) the agreement creates a voting trust` `the agreement is in writing` `the stock is capital stock of an original issue deposited with, or capital stock transferred to, a person or entity authorized to act as trustee` `the purpose is to vest in the voting trustee the right to vote on the stock for a period of time the agreement determines` MEANS
        `the agreement is in writing`
    AND `the stock is capital stock of an original issue deposited with, or capital stock transferred to, a person or entity authorized to act as trustee`
    AND `the purpose is to vest in the voting trustee the right to vote on the stock for a period of time the agreement determines`

-- After delivery of a copy of the agreement to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal
-- place of business, certificates of stock or uncertificated stock are issued to the voting trustee, and the stock
-- transferred to the trustee is surrendered and cancelled and new certificates or uncertificated stock are issued to the trustee.
-- src:829 | After delivery of a copy of the agreement to the registered office of the corporation in this State or the principal place of business of the corporation, which copy shall be open to the inspection of any stockholder of the corporation or any beneficiary of the trust under the agreement daily during business hours, certificates of stock or uncertificated stock shall be issued to the voting trustee or trustees to represent any stock of an original issue so deposited with such voting trustee or trustees, and any certificates of stock or uncertificated stock so transferred to the voting trustee or trustees shall be surrendered and cancelled and new certificates or uncertificated stock shall be issued therefore to the voting trustee or trustees. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
GIVEN `a copy of the agreement has been delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(a) the corporation must issue stock to the voting trustee in place of the stock deposited or transferred` `a copy of the agreement has been delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business` MEANS
    `a copy of the agreement has been delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business`

-- The copy is open to the inspection of any stockholder of the corporation or any beneficiary of the trust under the agreement
-- daily during business hours.
-- src:829 | which copy shall be open to the inspection of any stockholder of the corporation or any beneficiary of the trust under the agreement daily during business hours, certificates of stock or uncertificated stock shall be issued to the voting trustee or trustees to represent any stock of an original issue so deposited with such voting trustee or trustees, and any certificates of stock or uncertificated stock so transferred to the voting trustee or trustees shall be surrendered and cancelled and new certificates or uncertificated stock shall be issued therefore to the voting trustee or trustees. In the certificate so issued, if any, it shall be stated that it is issued pursuant to such agreement, and that fact shall also be stated in the stock ledger of the corporation. The voting trustee or trustees may vote the stock so issued or transferred during the period specified in the agreement. Stock standing in the name of the voting trustee or trustees may be voted either in person or by proxy, and in voting the stock, the voting trustee or trustees shall incur no responsibility as stockholder, trustee or otherwise, except for their own individual malfeasance. In any case where 2 or more persons or entities are designated as voting trustees, and the right and method of voting any stock standing in their names at any meeting of the corporation are not fixed by the agreement appointing the trustees, the right to vote the stock and the manner of voting it at the meeting shall be determined by a majority of the trustees, or if they be equally divided as to the right and manner of voting the stock in any particular case, the vote of the stock in such case shall be divided equally among the trustees.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
GIVEN `the person is a stockholder of the corporation or a beneficiary of the trust under the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a copy of the agreement has been delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person asks during business hours` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(a) the person may inspect the copy of the voting trust agreement` `the person is a stockholder of the corporation or a beneficiary of the trust under the agreement` `a copy of the agreement has been delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business` `the person asks during business hours` MEANS
        `the person is a stockholder of the corporation or a beneficiary of the trust under the agreement`
    AND `a copy of the agreement has been delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business`
    AND `the person asks during business hours`

-- The certificate, if any, states that it is issued pursuant to the agreement, and that fact is also stated in the stock ledger.
-- src:829 | In the certificate so issued, if any, it shall be stated that it is issued pursuant to such agreement, and that fact shall also be stated in the stock ledger of the corporation. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
GIVEN `a certificate was issued to the voting trustee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the certificate states that it is issued pursuant to the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the stock ledger states that the stock is issued pursuant to the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(a) the certificate and the stock ledger state that the stock is issued pursuant to the agreement` `a certificate was issued to the voting trustee` `the certificate states that it is issued pursuant to the agreement` `the stock ledger states that the stock is issued pursuant to the agreement` MEANS
        (   (NOT `a certificate was issued to the voting trustee`)
         OR `the certificate states that it is issued pursuant to the agreement`)
    AND `the stock ledger states that the stock is issued pursuant to the agreement`

-- The voting trustee may vote the stock so issued or transferred during the period specified in the agreement, in person or by
-- proxy, and incurs no responsibility as stockholder, trustee or otherwise, except for the trustee's own individual malfeasance.
-- src:829 | The voting trustee or trustees may vote the stock so issued or transferred during the period specified in the agreement. Stock standing in the name of the voting trustee or trustees may be voted either in person or by proxy, and in voting the stock, the voting trustee or trustees shall incur no responsibility as stockholder, trustee or otherwise, except for their own individual malfeasance. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
GIVEN `the day the stock is voted is within the period specified in the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(a) the voting trustee may vote the stock in person or by proxy` `the day the stock is voted is within the period specified in the agreement` MEANS
    `the day the stock is voted is within the period specified in the agreement`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
GIVEN `the trustee is guilty of individual malfeasance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(a) the voting trustee incurs responsibility as stockholder, trustee or otherwise in voting the stock` `the trustee is guilty of individual malfeasance` MEANS
    `the trustee is guilty of individual malfeasance`

-- Where 2 or more are designated voting trustees and the agreement does not fix the right and method of voting at a meeting, a
-- majority of the trustees determines the right to vote the stock and how; if they are equally divided, the vote of the stock
-- is divided equally among the trustees.
-- src:829 | In any case where 2 or more persons or entities are designated as voting trustees, and the right and method of voting any stock standing in their names at any meeting of the corporation are not fixed by the agreement appointing the trustees, the right to vote the stock and the manner of voting it at the meeting shall be determined by a majority of the trustees, or if they be equally divided as to the right and manner of voting the stock in any particular case, the vote of the stock in such case shall be divided equally among the trustees.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
DECLARE `s 218(a) How the stock is voted by two or more voting trustees` IS ONE OF
    `as the agreement appointing the trustees fixes`
    `as determined by a majority of the trustees`
    `the vote of the stock is divided equally among the trustees`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(a) (src:829)
GIVEN `the agreement appointing the trustees fixes the right and method of voting the stock at the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the trustees are equally divided as to the right and manner of voting the stock in this case` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `s 218(a) How the stock is voted by two or more voting trustees`
`s 218(a) how the stock is voted when two or more persons or entities are voting trustees` `the agreement appointing the trustees fixes the right and method of voting the stock at the meeting` `the trustees are equally divided as to the right and manner of voting the stock in this case` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the agreement appointing the trustees fixes the right and method of voting the stock at the meeting` THEN `as the agreement appointing the trustees fixes`
        IF `the trustees are equally divided as to the right and manner of voting the stock in this case` THEN `the vote of the stock is divided equally among the trustees`
        OTHERWISE `as determined by a majority of the trustees`

§§ `s 218(b) Amending the voting trust agreement`

-- src:830 | (b) Any amendment to a voting trust agreement shall be made by a written agreement, a copy of which shall be delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or principal place of business of the corporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(b) (src:830)
GIVEN `the amendment is made by a written agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a copy of the amendment is delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(b) the amendment to the voting trust agreement is made as the subsection requires` `the amendment is made by a written agreement` `a copy of the amendment is delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business` MEANS
        `the amendment is made by a written agreement`
    AND `a copy of the amendment is delivered to the registered office of the corporation in this State or to its principal place of business`

§§ `s 218(c) Voting agreements between stockholders`

-- An agreement between 2 or more stockholders, if in writing and signed by the parties, may provide that in exercising any
-- voting rights the shares held by them shall be voted as provided by the agreement, or as the parties may agree, or as
-- determined in accordance with a procedure agreed upon by them.
-- src:831 | (c) An agreement between 2 or more stockholders, if in writing and signed by the parties thereto, may provide that in exercising any voting rights, the shares held by them shall be voted as provided by the agreement, or as the parties may agree, or as determined in accordance with a procedure agreed upon by them.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(c) (src:831)
GIVEN `the agreement is between 2 or more stockholders` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the agreement is in writing` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the agreement is signed by the parties to it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 218(c) the agreement may provide how the shares held by the parties are voted` `the agreement is between 2 or more stockholders` `the agreement is in writing` `the agreement is signed by the parties to it` MEANS
        `the agreement is between 2 or more stockholders`
    AND `the agreement is in writing`
    AND `the agreement is signed by the parties to it`

§§ `s 218(d) Other agreements and irrevocable proxies are not invalidated`

-- This section shall not be deemed to invalidate any voting or other agreement among stockholders or any irrevocable proxy which
-- is not otherwise illegal. If it is otherwise illegal, this section does not say whether it is valid: NOTHING.
-- src:832 | (d) This section shall not be deemed to invalidate any voting or other agreement among stockholders or any irrevocable proxy which is not otherwise illegal.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 218(d) (src:832)
GIVEN `the voting or other agreement among stockholders or the irrevocable proxy is otherwise illegal` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 218(d) this section invalidates the voting or other agreement among stockholders or the irrevocable proxy` `the voting or other agreement among stockholders or the irrevocable proxy is otherwise illegal` MEANS
    IF `the voting or other agreement among stockholders or the irrevocable proxy is otherwise illegal`
    THEN NOTHING
    ELSE JUST FALSE
